   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS 2025 Hogar Maria Luisa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &apos;My School, My Home&apos; project, implemented by Hogar Maria Luisa in Buenos Aires, Argentina, aims to support continued schoolgoing and improved school performance in children and adolescents living in institutional care. The project provides personalized academic support and emotional guidance through tutoring, school reintegration, vocational guidance, and life skills development activities, in coordination with public schools. The project will benefit approximately 80 to 90 children and young people aged between 4 and 21 years residing at the care home.</narrative>
  </description>
